	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_sodateya_oldman_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>よくきたな！▼
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]と
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="1" ]は　げんきじゃぞ！▼
２ひきの　なかは
とっても　よいようじゃ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>よく来たな！▼
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]と
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="1" ]は　元気じゃぞ！▼
２匹の　仲は
とっても　よいようじゃ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：育て屋じいさん
・タマゴなし
・預けているポケモン＝２匹
・７０％の確率で生まれる
　キー待ちあり</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>おじいさん</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
