	<TextRow
		Label="msg_sodateya_oldman_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>よくきたな！▼
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]と
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="1" ]は　げんきじゃぞ！▼
２ひきは　おたがいに
ちがう　ポケモンたちと▽
あそんでおるがなあ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>よく来たな！▼
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]と
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="1" ]は　元気じゃぞ！▼
２匹は　おたがいに
違う　ポケモンたちと▽
遊んでおるがなあ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
